                            "text": "<p>Repco came to us with a brief as clear as their brand: uniforms that looked sharp, felt comfortable and captured the spirit of a 100-year motorsport legacy. The challenge wasn't just designing a great retail uniform — it was designing one that felt unmistakably Repco, across every store, every role, every team member.</p>",
                            "device_visibility": "all",
                            "width": "100%",
                            "max_width": "normal",
                            "alignment": "left",
                            "type_preset": "custom",
                            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                            "font_size": "0.875rem",
                            "line_height": "normal",
                            "letter_spacing": "normal",
                            "case": "none",
                            "wrap": "pretty",
                            "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                            "background": false,
                            "background_color": "#00000026",
                            "corner_radius": 0,
                            "padding-block-start": 0,
                            "padding-block-end": 0,
                            "padding-inline-start": 0,
                            "padding-inline-end": 0
                          },
                          "blocks": {}
                        }
                      },
                      "block_order": [
                        "text_RAGdEQ"
                      ]
                    },
                    "accordion_row_gHYCdz": {
                      "type": "_accordion-row",
                      "settings": {
                        "heading": "Our Custom Uniform Solution",
                        "open_by_default": false,
                        "icon": "none",
                        "width": 20,
                        "scroll_to_reviews": false
                      },
                      "blocks": {
                        "text_wCK9yV": {
                          "type": "text",
                          "settings": {
                            "class_name": "",
                            "text": "<p>Inspired by Repco's collaboration with racing icon Sir Jack Brabham, we designed the Brabham — a pit crew polo built for the sales floor. Anti-wrinkle cotton-rich fabric. Ventilation panels. Reinforced seams. Breathable eyelets. Multiple sponsor logos embroidered with precision. Sharp enough for a showroom. Durable enough for a century-old brand that doesn't slow down.</p>",
                            "device_visibility": "all",
                            "width": "100%",
                            "max_width": "normal",
                            "alignment": "left",
                            "type_preset": "custom",
                            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                            "font_size": "0.875rem",
                            "line_height": "normal",
                            "letter_spacing": "normal",
                            "case": "none",
                            "wrap": "pretty",
                            "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                            "background": false,
                            "background_color": "#00000026",
                            "corner_radius": 0,
                            "padding-block-start": 0,
                            "padding-block-end": 0,
                            "padding-inline-start": 0,
                            "padding-inline-end": 0
                          },
                          "blocks": {}
                        }
                      },
                      "block_order": [
                        "text_wCK9yV"
                      ]
                    },
                    "accordion_row_rwKWhT": {
                      "type": "_accordion-row",
                      "settings": {
                        "heading": "Repco's Ready-To-Wear Solution",
                        "open_by_default": false,
                        "icon": "none",
                        "width": 20,
                        "scroll_to_reviews": false
                      },
                      "blocks": {
                        "text_PEx76n": {
                          "type": "text",
                          "settings": {
                            "class_name": "",
                            "text": "<p>Flexibility built into the program. A range of stock service styles — shirts, pants, skirts, outerwear, knitwear — gave Repco staff the freedom to mix and match while keeping the brand cohesive across every location. Accessible through a tailored online portal, with wage deduction options making the process seamless for staff.</p>",
                            "device_visibility": "all",
                            "width": "100%",
                            "max_width": "none",
                            "alignment": "left",
                            "type_preset": "custom",
                            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                            "font_size": "0.875rem",
                            "line_height": "normal",
                            "letter_spacing": "normal",
                            "case": "none",
                            "wrap": "pretty",
                            "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                            "background": false,
                            "background_color": "#00000026",
                            "corner_radius": 0,
                            "padding-block-start": 0,
                            "padding-block-end": 0,
                            "padding-inline-start": 0,
                            "padding-inline-end": 0
                          },
                          "blocks": {}
                        }
                      },
                      "block_order": [
                        "text_PEx76n"
                      ]
                    },
                    "accordion_row_bTjE7i": {
                      "type": "_accordion-row",
                      "settings": {
                        "heading": "How We Delivered",
                        "open_by_default": false,
                        "icon": "none",
                        "width": 20,
                        "scroll_to_reviews": false
                      },
                      "blocks": {
                        "text_wzmrNB": {
                          "type": "text",
                          "settings": {
                            "class_name": "",
                            "text": "<p>A customised online portal gave staff full control — ordering, tracking, returns, all in one place. Management gained live inventory reporting and simplified admin oversight. We handled manufacturing, warehousing and fulfilment. The result: orders surged, feedback was overwhelmingly positive, and Repco's team hit the floor looking the part from day one.<br/><em>\"Thank you so much for your continual effort on all things uniforms. The DTY level of service is #1!\"</em><br/>— Ross, Repco</p>",
                            "device_visibility": "all",
                            "width": "100%",
                            "max_width": "none",
                            "alignment": "left",
                            "type_preset": "custom",
                            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                            "font_size": "0.875rem",
                            "line_height": "normal",
                            "letter_spacing": "normal",
                            "case": "none",
                            "wrap": "pretty",
                            "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                            "background": false,
                            "background_color": "#00000026",
                            "corner_radius": 0,
                            "padding-block-start": 0,
                            "padding-block-end": 0,
                            "padding-inline-start": 0,
                            "padding-inline-end": 0
                          },
                          "blocks": {}
                        }
                      },
                      "block_order": [
                        "text_wzmrNB"
                      ]
                    },
                    "accordion_row_YzyQGw": {
                      "type": "_accordion-row",
                      "settings": {
                        "heading": "Services Provided",
                        "open_by_default": false,
                        "icon": "none",
                        "width": 20,
                        "scroll_to_reviews": false
                      },
                      "blocks": {
                        "text_pbzzEU": {
                          "type": "text",
                          "settings": {
                            "class_name": "",
                            "text": "<p>Custom polos and pit crew shirts. Multiple garment embellishments. Dedicated account manager. Live inventory and ordering reports. Digital catalogue. Wage deductions and personal purchase options. Customised online portal. Made-for-you uniform service.</p>",
                            "device_visibility": "all",
                            "width": "100%",
                            "max_width": "none",
